# Mission Control Snapshot (CO-ARCH-005 / CO-MC-002)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Permanent · Executive Intelligence Platform

## Principle

Mission Control **consumes** scheduled Enterprise Intelligence snapshots.  
It **never** executes heavy analytics on page load.

## CO-MC-002 layout

- Full-width analytics cards · **one card per row**
- Twelve business sections (Executive Summary → AI Executive Intelligence)
- Graph-first presentation (funnel, line, bar, donut, treemap, heatmap, waterfall, area, network)
- Vertical scroll preferred

## Analytics Refresh

- Daily **02:00 AM Asia/Kolkata** (`30 20 * * *` UTC on Vercel Cron)
- Aggregates KPIs / chart datasets during refresh only
- Mission Control reads **only** precomputed `intelligence` pack + EBI snapshot

## Tiers

Aligns with CO-ARCH-003:

- Tier 1 ops must not be blocked by Mission Control  
- Snapshot generation is Tier 3 (scheduled / admin force)

## SSOT

| Concern | Path |
|---------|------|
| Schedule constants | `src/constants/mission-control-snapshot.ts` · `mission-control-enterprise-intelligence.ts` |
| Compose | `server/services/enterprise-metrics-engine/compose-mission-control-snapshot.ts` |
| Intelligence derive | `src/lib/mission-control-enterprise-intelligence/` |
| Persist / cron | Enterprise Metrics Engine · `POST /api/cron/enterprise-metrics` |
| Read API | `GET /api/enterprise-metrics/mission-control` |
| UI | `src/mission-control/enterprise-intelligence/` · Executive Briefing |
| Admin | `/admin/enterprise-metrics` |

## Permissions

- **Administrators:** configure schedule · Force Recalculate · view history  
- **Management / Executives:** view current snapshot only  
- **Employees:** existing MC permissions  

## Forbidden

- Live org-wide KPI recompute on Mission Control open  
- Manual refresh for non-administrators  
- Parallel formula engines for MC health / KPIs  
- Two-column competing analytics grids on the Executive Intelligence report  
